@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### List Events (Keyset Pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events?limit=25
Accept: application/json

### List Events by Severity and Camera
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events?severity=CRITICAL,HIGH&camera_id=CAM-01
Accept: application/json

### List Events by Plate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events?plate=KA01AB1234
Accept: application/json

### Get Event Detail by UUID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json
